        "202110000": {
          "id": 202110000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "主爵，我正在准备自己的第一次「极限探险」计划",
          "next": [
            202110001
          ]
        },
        "202110001": {
          "id": 202110001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "汝等穿越星际，定能向我直谏更全面的建议",
          "next": [
            202110002,
            202110004,
            202110005
          ]
        },
        "202110002": {
          "id": 202110002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "你一个人吗？准备去哪儿玩？",
          "next": [
            202110003
          ]
        },
        "202110003": {
          "id": 202110003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "若有人想一同前往，凯撒当然不会反对。",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110004": {
          "id": 202110004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "准备去哪儿玩？",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110005": {
          "id": 202110005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "请登上星穹列车",
          "next": [
            202110006
          ]
        },
        "202110006": {
          "id": 202110006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "也许能作为我旅途的一站，不过先留待以后再说",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110007": {
          "id": 202110007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "目的地：未来的翁法罗斯",
          "next": [
            202110008
          ]
        },
        "202110008": {
          "id": 202110008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "往日行于征途，记忆中的万邦不是纷争烈火，便是黑潮死水",
          "next": [
            202110009
          ]
        },
        "202110009": {
          "id": 202110009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "当记忆的种子盛放，翁法罗斯会焕发生机，我正好也可以一探",
          "next": [
            202110010
          ]
        },
        "202110010": {
          "id": 202110010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "我想驾驶帆船穿越斯基亚纳的海域，那儿的乌云和巨浪无时无刻不在搏斗",
          "next": [
            202110011
          ]
        },
        "202110011": {
          "id": 202110011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "听说过拉冬吗？那里有一处极高之地，能够触及云层",
          "next": [
            202110012
          ]
        },
        "202110012": {
          "id": 202110012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "正在思考是翼装飞行，还是高空跳伞",
          "next": [
            202110013
          ]
        },
        "202110013": {
          "id": 202110013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "主爵有何建议？",
          "next": [
            202110014,
            202110016,
            202110019
          ]
        },
        "202110014": {
          "id": 202110014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我都可以，毕竟之前也经常旋转跳跃，然后高空降落进入一个世界",
          "next": [
            202110015
          ]
        },
        "202110015": {
          "id": 202110015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "听起来甚好",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110016": {
          "id": 202110016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "说来话长…我经常通过高空降落的方式进入一个世界",
          "next": [
            202110017
          ]
        },
        "202110017": {
          "id": 202110017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "不如你也试试",
          "next": [
            202110018
          ]
        },
        "202110018": {
          "id": 202110018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "听起来甚好",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110019": {
          "id": 202110019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "请珍爱生命！",
          "next": [
            202110020
          ]
        },
        "202110020": {
          "id": 202110020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "放心，凯撒可没有那么娇气",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110021": {
          "id": 202110021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "前不久刚接受了小猫儿的野外求生特训，金织爵的绳索编织培训",
          "next": [
